WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.353
The most effective advertising is famous, emotional, single-minded and memorable.

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:08.866
And differentiation is the biggest brand driver of all.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.876
Share a Coke put names on the bottles.

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:14.824
People hunted for their own name and shared the photos.

00:00:14.874 --> 00:00:17.261
Famous, and personal.

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:19.238
Why emotion?

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:24.173
Around ninety-five percent of buying is intuitive, so feelings beat facts.

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.244
Use it as a checklist:

00:00:26.294 --> 00:00:28.272
score the campaign on each trait,

00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:31.041
and fix the weakest one first.
